WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:36.390
Mashymre fell in the
airspace of Axis.

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:40.370
But Haman barely even noticed.

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:46.400
VIBRATION

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:52.180
Who are these guys?

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:54.180
Glemy's Newtype corps!

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.740
Newtype corps?

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:58.550
Our fleet's short-handed now!
Please, let's go back!

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:00.690
Retreat just because
those things showed up?!

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:13.270
They're coming.
Are you ready?

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:16.840
Yes!

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:20.390
For Master Glemy,
I'll strike Haman's fleet,

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:22.710
even if it costs me my life!

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.820
Don't make me laugh!
It'll take more than that!

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:56.710
GO!

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.050
Mistress Chara, please pull back!

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:06.900
No!

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:08.750
Lady Haman orders it!

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:16.260
Chara! Don't charge out too far!
Think of your situation!

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:17.960
Judau?

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.670
All right!
I should go back, right?

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:26.190
Judau, what do we do?
We can't take those head-on!

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:28.340
We'll go back to the Nahel Argama
and see how the battle goes.

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:04.040
Captain Bright!

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:04.900
Leina!

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:06.100
Captain!

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.910
You've finally returned,
Leina Ashta.

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:12.760
She's the one
who saved me!

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:15.490
l know her. Sayla Mass.

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:18.960
It's been a long time,
Bright Noa.

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:22.710
Sayla... I see you've been
keeping busy on Earth.

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:26.100
There's only so much a woman
can do alone as an investor.

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:30.170
Here. A video from
Mrs. Mirai and the children.

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:32.940
Th-Thanks.

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:36.910
For heaven's sake. I'd tell
you to write a letter, except...

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:41.150
Things are bad at
Side 3, aren't they?

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:46.350
Yes. A lot of young people
are fighting there now.

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:48.500
Like you all did, once.

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:50.360
I see.

00:04:57.430 --> 00:05:01.270
I'm about to leave
for Side 3, as well.

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:06.160
Do you know of any activity
by my brother... Char Aznable?

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:09.140
This is no time to go
looking for him.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:12.950
I haven't sensed Char's
will at work in this war.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:15.650
Even Haman Karn doesn't
know where he is, either?

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:19.850
No. He's somewhere now,
watching what we do.

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:22.550
Thinking up something new.

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:26.760
Waiting for the right era?
How typical of my brother.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.610
But I feel there's some danger.

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:33.020
It would be sad if Newtypes
remained only a concept.

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:35.880
Don't you think he
hates that, and now...

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:38.730
he's getting ready to
take concrete action?

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:42.540
I don't want to see my brother
do that. I'd rather he was dead.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:43.940
Why?

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:46.850
Ambition and delusion.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:49.520
It's as if my brother thinks...

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:53.250
he must obey some
sort of cosmic will.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:54.890
Does he really?

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.410
Who?! Who is it?!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:03.320
Stop trying to get into my head!

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:04.600
STOP IT!

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:10.370
What's Ple-Two doing?!

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:14.340
Send the Newtype corps
out further to the front!

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:15.320
Yes, sir!

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:17.400
Detach Mousa!

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:20.000
Yes, sir! Detaching Mousa!

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:29.050
Mousa separation, complete!

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:32.810
Adjust its course!
Crash it into Haman's forces!

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:33.900
Sir!

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:36.180
Haman Karn...

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:40.470
Your own ambition to rule
the world has led to you to ruin!

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:46.790
Mousa has started
moving away from Axis!

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:49.840
They're going to crash that
huge thing into Haman's fleet!

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.970
I see!
Break their formation,

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:54.050
then hit them with
the Newtype corps!

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:57.050
Then their relative strength
won't be a problem.

00:06:57.050 --> 00:06:58.280
Judau!

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:00.300
I'll stop the Newtype corps!

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:02.350
Judau, wait!
You need resupply!

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:05.890
There's no time!
If we don't hit Glemy now...!

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:10.230
Where the hell's the AEUG fleet?!
When are they coming?!

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:14.070
What's all this crap
you've stuck on it?!

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:15.070
It's so heavy now!

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:16.570
Missile pods!

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:19.840
After you use them,
jettison them as a distraction!

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:22.910
Gundam Double Zeta, moving out!

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:35.100
Mousa has
opened fire on us!

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:38.760
Spread out the fleet!
Send our mobile suit units forward!

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:39.760
Aye!

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:44.530
Mousa is the symbol of Neo Zeon,
and he uses it as a shield?!

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:47.270
Glemy... you'll pay for this!

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:55.040
What's wrong, Ple-Two?

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:57.640
I'll fortify the rear!
Move forward!

00:07:57.640 --> 00:07:59.550
I know it, Rakan.

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:02.760
Here it comes!

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:05.970
Nee! Lance!
I'll take that thing!

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:12.720
Let me be clear.
I'm not letting you past!

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:15.860
Who are you to talk,
after stealing Lady Haman's Axis?!

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:17.960
That's why we're sending
Mousa back to you!

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:19.670
Spare me the jokes!

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:28.570
All you do is run!

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.680
Chara! Stop!

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:36.430
What's this?
I sense another presence.

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:41.850
A beam like that...!

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:44.390
l have you!

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:51.130
Nee! Take care of Mistress Chara!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:53.130
Out of my way!

00:08:56.270 --> 00:08:57.370
Lance!

00:08:57.370 --> 00:09:00.240
M-Mistress Chara! Please, retreat!

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:02.610
You won't escape!

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:06.110
STOP!

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:08.280
Him!

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:18.620
Did I get him?!

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:23.170
It'll take more than
those missiles!

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:24.200
Ple-Two!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:30.220
Don't go!
Don't interfere with Judau!

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:32.070
Get out of that mobile suit!

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:37.010
It's you! You're the one who's
been trying to get inside my head!

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:39.590
Judau's not your enemy!

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:42.510
Why can't you see how good
you feel when he's with you?!

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:46.350
Stop it!
I won't let you confuse me!

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:53.760
Why?! It doesn't affect him!
Does he have a barrier?

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:55.060
Ple-Two!

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:56.190
GET LOST!

00:09:58.140 --> 00:09:59.400
What?!

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:10.480
Little punk!

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:18.520
How?! It's piloted by a child!

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:26.310
Come back, Ple-Two!

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:28.690
Doing what Glemy says
won't get you anywhere!

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:32.660
Deputy Captain!
Axis's defense line is collapsing!

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:36.070
Haman's mobile suit
forces are charging in!

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:39.290
Where's the Gundam Team?!
Where are Judau and the others?!

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:41.340
It looks like they're
inside the defense line!

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:43.740
They went into Axis?!
Just the three of them?!

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:05.220
Did the counterattack
come too late?

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:13.210
- It's gonna hit!
- No! It's just on the edge!

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:22.140
Mousa's course was changed!

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:23.400
I know!

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:26.610
Our strength has been
reduced by 15%!

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:29.250
Increase Axis's speed!

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:31.760
Ram Axis into Core 3!

00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:33.460
B-But, sir...!

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:38.360
Haman! You won't dodge
this as easily as Mousa!

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:50.110
Ple-Two, where are you?

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:58.200
- Roux! Judau's gone inside!
- Is he trying to get himself killed?!

00:11:58.200 --> 00:11:59.950
- Let's go!
- Dammit!

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:15.910
Direction, confirmed!
Axis is headed for us, this time!

00:12:15.910 --> 00:12:18.580
We can't afford to lose Axis.

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:21.700
Dispatch commandos to infiltrate
Axis and change its course!

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:22.660
Aye!

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:25.960
Is this...?

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:29.090
I see, Judau...
You've entered Axis!

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:34.180
Glemy's somewhere in here?

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:44.270
Enemy mobile suit has
broken into M block!

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:45.850
They think it's a Gundam!

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:48.940
And what are our mobile
suits doing about it?!

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:51.110
Ple-Two is acting strangely.

00:12:51.110 --> 00:12:52.110
How so?

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:54.530
She's coming
straight back here!

00:12:54.530 --> 00:12:56.200
She's what?

00:12:57.820 --> 00:12:59.330
What's happening?!

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:05.830
Ple-Two!

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:08.290
What's wrong?

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:11.300
Wasn't the Quin Mantha's
psycommu perfected?

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:13.840
- I-It should be.
- Then why?!

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:16.760
Her waves have been unstable
for some time now.

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:19.640
Glemy...

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:22.350
Ple-Two!
Why did you come back?!

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:25.940
It's Ple.
Ple keeps trying to stop me!

00:13:25.940 --> 00:13:28.600
Ple? Get a hold of yourself!

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:31.150
Ple is long dead.

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:33.400
It's just the Gundam
confusing you.

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:36.530
All you need to do is defeat it.

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:39.160
And I won't feel sick anymore?

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:44.160
You won't! And for that,
give me your powers!

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:47.170
Master Glemy!
What are you doing?!

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:52.550
With your powers and mine,

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:55.010
we'll cast the Gundam
into the dark depths of space!

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:01.220
Judau, where did you go?

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:08.810
Zeta Gundam! Roux Louka...
l will...

00:14:12.110 --> 00:14:15.780
Go on! Destroy the enemy
that puts you in shackles, Ple-Two!

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:18.570
The enemy that puts me in shackles...

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:23.870
Elle!

00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:38.550
The main monitor!

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:42.930
You see?
Nobody can stand in our way.

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:44.510
Yes, you're right.

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:49.520
Roux!

00:14:58.650 --> 00:15:01.070
J-Judau!
What's keeping you?!

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:05.080
Elle, where are you?!

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:08.790
Elle, run for it!

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:11.080
l know, but...!

00:15:14.210 --> 00:15:18.590
Ple-Two! Destroy that
Gundam, and you'll feel better!

00:15:18.590 --> 00:15:19.630
Destroy it...?

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:21.550
- Yes!
- Right.

00:15:25.260 --> 00:15:26.810
Stop it, Ple-Two!

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:30.310
- Judau's coming!
- What?!

00:15:37.110 --> 00:15:40.190
Nothing will come of
your working for Glemy!

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:42.660
How dare you say that,
when you're making me sick!

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:46.120
That's right! That's the
enemy you must destroy!

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:48.120
Let me go!

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:52.670
Do you want to end up
as Glemy's puppet, Ple-Two?!

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:56.790
Ple-Two, come back!
He's the enemy!

00:15:58.300 --> 00:15:59.130
Ple-Two!

00:15:59.300 --> 00:16:03.380
Ple-Two,
Glemy's just using you!

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:06.390
I have a great cause
that I must fight for!

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:09.470
Why do you fight when you
can't see what justice means?!

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:11.140
W-Well...

00:16:12.980 --> 00:16:14.350
Judau!

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:20.570
You fight because
you're a mere soldier.

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:23.650
You only pilot that Gundam
due to circumstance.

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:26.570
But I'm different.

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:30.660
I chose a harsh life to live,
and I've no regrets about it!

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:33.790
You have no urge boiling
within that drives you!

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:36.460
You're garbage, and I want
you out of my sight!

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:38.210
You're wrong!

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:42.880
I understand the mistakes caused
by people's individual desires!

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:45.640
That's why... why I...!

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:48.930
That anger and frustration...

00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:52.560
born from your intuition
becomes your reason to fight!

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:57.310
Kamille didn't fight because
someone ordered him to.

00:16:57.310 --> 00:16:59.270
He believed he
should save the world.

00:17:02.360 --> 00:17:04.860
Your feelings are
honest, Big Brother.

00:17:04.860 --> 00:17:06.860
I'm Elpeo Ple!

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:11.700
I understand.

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:15.210
I'm sure of it.

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:17.540
I fight carrying everyone's
will with me...

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:19.840
against the self-righteousness
of an egotist!

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:23.050
Everyone's will?

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:27.890
You keep talking about blood,
but where did that come from?

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:29.220
Earth.

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:33.470
The place that gave birth
to all life, our homeland!

00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:37.230
The blood of the Zabi family
is just one part of billions!

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:41.770
If that's enough to cause
a war, then keep it at Axis!

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:47.490
Earth's polluted, and our colonies
are old and decrepit!

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:52.410
Right now,
humanity needs a fresh start.

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:56.120
People like you, who are
obsessed with little things...

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:59.250
If you aren't stopped, the Earth Sphere
will never see a future!

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:03.250
People who are bound by blood
are just in the way!

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:04.760
Judau!

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:09.640
I won't let human possibility be crushed
for some petty self-satisfaction!

00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:11.260
Is that you, Big Brother?

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:14.390
My head hurts...!

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:17.310
It... it'll keep hurting,
as long as he still lives.

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:18.190
But...!

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:21.940
Ple-Two, Judau is
saying kind things to you.

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:23.270
Ple-Two.

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:25.990
Judau is...?

00:18:25.990 --> 00:18:28.950
Here. Come to us, Ple-Two.

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:29.860
Ple...

00:18:29.860 --> 00:18:33.490
What're you saying?!
You're a part of me!

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:36.080
Don't be confused!
Come on!

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:37.540
Ple-Two!

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:40.170
Ple-Two, fight!

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:41.500
Stop it!

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:43.590
How long will you allow
the enemy to confuse you?!

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:45.300
Stop it!

00:18:46.090 --> 00:18:48.970
l hate everyone!
GO AWAY!

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:53.890
Th-That light...!

00:18:53.890 --> 00:18:58.890
Judau, save Ple-Two!
She's coming to us!

00:18:59.690 --> 00:19:01.060
I hear you, Ple!

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:06.150
That's it! That's the way!
Kill Judau!

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:20.870
Glemy...

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:26.380
Is the Double Zeta invulnerable?!

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:28.010
- Judau?!
- Don't go!

00:19:30.090 --> 00:19:31.550
It's gone!

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:39.350
Glemy, let Ple-Two go!

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:40.310
Shut up!

00:19:41.060 --> 00:19:42.480
Judau, take me!

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:43.270
Come back!

00:19:43.270 --> 00:19:44.940
Let go!

00:19:50.570 --> 00:19:54.490
I'll never forget
that you loved me.

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:05.880
Y-You, Roux Louka?

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:09.380
It was you who killed me?

00:20:11.970 --> 00:20:13.180
I'm sorry...!

00:20:13.470 --> 00:20:14.970
GLEMY!

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:25.730
Glemy's waves have vanished.

00:20:25.730 --> 00:20:28.820
Report from the commando
team that infiltrated Axis!

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:31.780
Axis's propulsion systems
have been destroyed.

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:33.860
It's impossible to
change its direction!

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:38.330
All forces, fall back!
Have all mobile suits withdraw!

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:39.580
Aye!

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:45.120
Come back alive, Judau Ashta!
We'll end this ourselves.

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:48.090
Axis and Core 3
are going to collide!

00:20:48.090 --> 00:20:51.170
- What about Judau and the others?!
- Can't you contact them?!

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:53.550
It's no use!
I can't get through!

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:55.970
- Where are you going?!
- To get them!

00:20:55.970 --> 00:20:58.510
You'll only be caught in the
shock wave when they collide!

00:20:58.510 --> 00:21:00.640
I can't just abandon my friends!

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:04.060
You wouldn't say that if you knew
how bad this collision will be!

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:05.690
Deputy Captain!

00:21:05.690 --> 00:21:08.610
Believe in Judau and the others!
They'll make it out!

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:11.780
Yeah! Roux and Elle
are too stubborn to die!

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:15.360
All right!
Nahel Argama, fall back!

00:21:34.970 --> 00:21:37.590
The force of the explosion
is pushing Axis away.

00:21:37.590 --> 00:21:39.470
What about Judau
and the others?

00:21:49.270 --> 00:21:51.610
The explosions on
Axis are spreading.

00:21:51.610 --> 00:21:54.280
It's no use. They can't
escape from that!

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:02.700
It's the Double Zeta!

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:04.580
You did it, Judau!

00:22:04.580 --> 00:22:07.830
Hold it! Where are the
Mk. II and the Zeta?

00:22:07.830 --> 00:22:09.580
Judau! Judau!
Do you read me?!

00:22:09.580 --> 00:22:11.880
Yeah, I read you, Iino!

00:22:11.880 --> 00:22:13.500
Where are Elle and Roux?!

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:15.920
Here with me, and both fine!

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:18.760
Beecha!
Sorry to worry you.

00:22:18.760 --> 00:22:20.090
We'll be back soon!

00:22:20.090 --> 00:22:24.350
- Roger!
- Whew! They really scared me!

00:22:24.350 --> 00:22:25.520
Seriously!

00:22:26.060 --> 00:22:29.440
Hang on, Ple-Two.
Don't die.

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:47.200 --> 00:23:50.710
Haman has come out to
settle things between us!

00:23:50.710 --> 00:23:53.090
She's cool, and honorable!

00:23:53.090 --> 00:23:55.420
Still, if I lose this one, I'm dead!

00:23:55.420 --> 00:23:59.630
I'm not kidding here!
But her power's incredible!

00:23:59.630 --> 00:24:03.140
Somebody, help!
Sorry, that just slipped out.

00:24:03.140 --> 00:24:07.140
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Warrior, Once More..."

00:24:04.810 --> 00:24:07.930
Next Time

00:24:04.810 --> 00:24:07.930
WARRIOR, ONCE MORE...

00:24:07.980 --> 00:24:09.850
It's almost like
Haman loved me...!
